Package: micropolis
Architecture: any
Depends:
 micropolis-data (= ${source:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: alsa-utils
Description: classic real-time city management simulator
 Micropolis is the historical X11/Tcl/Tk city simulation released as free
 software by Electronic Arts and maintained by Don Hopkins. This package
 contains the native simulator executable and launcher.
 .
 The data, scenarios, graphics, sounds and manual are shipped separately in
 micropolis-data.

Package: micropolis-data
Architecture: all
Depends:
 fonts-dejavu-core,
 ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: micropolis
Description: classic real-time city management simulator - data
 This package contains the architecture-independent data for the classic
 Micropolis X11/Tcl/Tk city simulator, including scenarios, graphics, sounds,
 Tcl resources and the original HTML manual.
